abstract: >-
  A four-volume, 217-page engineering specification and multi-agent prompt suite
  for deterministic, source-generated Three.js r185 (0.185.0) browser games with
  zero downloaded runtime assets. Includes Three.js Evidence Graph: Operational
  Manual v2.0 (64 pages), The Hollow Meridian: Third-Person Action RPG v1.0 (81
  pages), The Glass Ossuary: First-Person Mystery Horror v1.0 (36 pages), and
  Perihelion Breach: First-Person Sci-Fi Shooter Adventure v1.0 (36 pages),
  backed by standalone JSON Schema Draft 2020-12 contracts, 25 copy-pasteable
  orchestrator and specialist prompts, 3 golden reference runs, and native
  four-language documentation in English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, and Korean.
